A stylized, futuristic illustration of a digital bird perched on a blockchain node, with glowing neon lines connecting to a network of nodes, representing a top crypto Twitter project. The bird has a sleek metallic body with a subtle gradient from electric blue to teal, its eyes glowing amber. The background is a dark gradient from deep navy to black, with faint circuit patterns and scattered cryptocurrency symbols (BTC, ETH, SOL) in translucent silver. The overall mood is dynamic, tech-forward, and energetic, capturing the essence of a leading web3 social media platform.
